{"product_id":"how-to-use-innovation-and-creativity-in-the-workplace","title":"How To: Use Innovation and Creativity in the Workplace","description":"\u003cp\u003eUnlock Your Team's Creative Potential and Boost Productivity  Are you hungry to increase productivity in your workplace? Do you want to solve problems and enhance working relationships? In How to Use Innovation and Creativity in the Workplace, creative director Patrick Collister introduces practical techniques to get the creative juices flowing, no matter your career. Drawing from over 25 years' experience, Collister shares simple methods you can easily introduce into your working day.  Discover how to encourage the exchange of ideas with colleagues and make meaningful, positive changes. Learn to leverage technology and digital platforms, break established work patterns, and engineer working environments that harness creative potential and drive innovation. Packed with insights on streamlining processes, improving efficiency, and working well as a team, this guide will help you unlock your organisation's creative power and boost output.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Patrick Collister\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781509814459\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45885718036633,"sku":"12RA9781509814459","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69143038e55a0_How_To_Use_Innovation_and_Creativity_in_the_Workplace.jpg?v=1762965583","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/how-to-use-innovation-and-creativity-in-the-workplace","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}